[D]Heir of sal[G]vation, [D]purchase of God,
[G]born of His [D]Spirit, [A7]washed in His [D]blood.

{start_of_chorus}
[D]This is my [G]story, [D]this is my song,
[D]praising my [E7]Savior [A]all the day [A7]long;
